Warning: the Windows profile directory for %1 was left behind.\n\nIts registry entry was removed, but the directory itself is still at the old\nlocation - most often because a session was still using it.  Until it is\ndeleted, an account created with this name later will NOT get that directory\nback: Windows will not put a new profile where one already sits, and gives it\na suffixed home instead.  Anything kept in the old one, ssh keys included,\nwill not be found there.\n\nDelete the directory from an elevated prompt once nothing is using it.
